  "narrative": {
    "text": "Figure 2 — the same schema after a natural-language modification request. The two identical leaf definitions of Figure 1 have collapsed into ONE `compound` class carrying `name`/`mass`/`inchi`, and both `metal_salt` and `ligand` on the `experiments entry` now refer to it. The pair Fig. 1 → Fig. 2 is the paper's demonstration that a refactor can be requested in prose and applied to a validated model.",
